  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats completely line the interior carpet to provide all-encompassing protection. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\n2020-2026 Kia Soul\nDoes not fit vehicles with vinyl flooring,ONLY for carpet flooring.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: These floor mats are fit for 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 2025 2026 Kia Soul models only, not for vehicles with vinyl floors. 3D laser scanning technology gives full protection to both the front and back\nEco-Safe Certification: Our TPE floor mats are recyclable and durable, with approval by GRS ,SGS, IATF; Eco-safe material easily withstands the rigor of daily abuse for long-lasting performance in both arctic cold and tropical heat\nAll Season Protection & Non-Slip: The unique designed channels and raised edge can effectively trap liquids, snow, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean. Even in wet conditions, the hooks can effectively prevent the Kia Soul car mats from slipping. The mats are available for you.\nEasy To Clean: The textured skid-resistant surface is easily cleaned. Neither cumbersome vacuum cleaners nor harsh chemicals are needed; simply shake them out or spray them down with a hose, Please remove old floor mats before installing new floor liners\nWhy Choose Yitamotor: Our floor mats are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guard to your vehicle",
